      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Hard to go past WILD BEAU (1) who has raced four times for the new yard and recorded three big wins and a minor placing. Last start raced right away and scored by four lengths in this class. Rises a kilo but impossible to knock and will go close again. FIELD OF FLUTES (2) is nearing a win and looks a danger. Placed over 1200m last time but unbeaten in two runs this course and distance. Definite danger. Stablemate RISING SPHERE (3) is third-up and is a third-up winner. In the minors both runs this campaign and looks ready to fire. CABLE BOY (5) is a WA galloper having his first try here but his best figures stack right up and not to be underestimated. FLYING ANNIE (4) has ability and could take some beating.",
